# Data Pipeline Scenario Rules

- Each pipeline step is idempotent (re-running produces identical results)
- Data validation at every stage with Pydantic or Great Expectations
- Steps are unit-testable in isolation (mock external dependencies)
- Raw data is append-only; processed data is versioned
- Schema changes: add columns gracefully, backfill with defaults for historical
- Partition data by date for incremental processing
- Monitor: data quality metrics, step duration, row counts per step
- Airflow/Dagster DAG is version-controlled in `pipelines/`